  - id: n_greet
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Kim
    speakerId: npc_classmate_kim
    textJa: "あ、おつかれさまです！じゅぎょう、むずかしかったですね。"
    textReading: "あ、おつかれさまです！じゅぎょう、むずかしかったですね。"
    textVi: "A, cậu vất vả rồi! Tiết học khó nhỉ."
    textEn: "Oh, good work today! Class was tough, wasn't it?"
    textRomaji: "A, otsukaresama desu! Jugyou, muzukashikatta desu ne."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "はい、むずかしかったです。でも、おもしろかったです。"
      textVi: "Ừ, khó thật. Nhưng thú vị."
      textEn: "Yes, it was hard. But it was fun."
      nextNodeId: n_invite
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "Dùng quá khứ của tính từ đuôi い: むずかしかった, おもしろかった"
      grammarTags:
      - grammar.n5.i_adj_past
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.muzukashii
      - vocab.n5.omoshiroi
      setFlags: []
    - textJa: "おつかれさまです。"
      textVi: "Cậu cũng vất vả rồi."
      textEn: "Good work to you too."
      nextNodeId: n_invite
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: ResponseAccuracy
        value: 6
        reason: "Đáp lại おつかれさまです đúng phép"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.otsukaresama
      setFlags: []
    - textJa: "むずかしいでした。"
      textVi: "Đã khó. (sai ngữ pháp)"
      textEn: "It was difficult. (wrong grammar)"
      nextNodeId: n_greet_mistake
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: -6
        reason: "Tính từ đuôi い không chia quá khứ bằng でした: phải là むずかしかったです"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
      setFlags: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_greet_mistake
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_invite
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Kim
    speakerId: npc_classmate_kim
    textJa: "あはは、わたしも、よくまちがえます！「むずかしかったです」ですよ。いっしょにがんばりましょう。"
    textReading: "あはは、わたしも、よくまちがえます！「むずかしかったです」ですよ。いっしょにがんばりましょう。"
    textVi: "Haha, tớ cũng hay sai lắm! Phải là 「むずかしかったです」 đấy. Cùng cố gắng nhé."
    textEn: "Haha, I make that mistake all the time! It's 「むずかしかったです」. Let's do our best together."
    textRomaji: "Ahaha, watashi mo, yoku machigaemasu! \"Muzukashikatta desu\" desu yo. Issho ni ganbarimashou."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_invite
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Kim
    speakerId: npc_classmate_kim
    textJa: "ねえ、このあと、ひまですか。ゲームセンターに行きませんか。"
    textReading: "ねえ、このあと、ひまですか。ゲームセンターにいきませんか。"
    textVi: "Này, lát nữa cậu rảnh không? Đi Game Center không?"
    textEn: "Hey, are you free after this? Want to go to the Game Center?"
    textRomaji: "Nee, kono ato, hima desu ka. Geemu sentaa ni ikimasen ka."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "いいですね。行きましょう！"
      textVi: "Hay đấy. Đi thôi!"
      textEn: "Sounds good. Let's go!"
      nextNodeId: n_walk
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "Nhận lời 〜ませんか bằng 〜ましょう"
      grammarTags:
      - grammar.n5.masen_ka
      - grammar.n5.mashou
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.geemusentaa
      setFlags:
      - kim.arcade
    - textJa: "すみません、きょうは、ちょっと…。"
      textVi: "Xin lỗi, hôm nay thì hơi…"
      textEn: "Sorry, today is a bit…"
      nextNodeId: n_invite_later
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: ResponseAccuracy
        value: 6
        reason: "Từ chối khéo kiểu Nhật bằng ちょっと…"
      grammarTags:
      - grammar.n5.chotto
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.sumimasen
      setFlags: []
    - textJa: "ゲームセンターに行きませんか。"
      textVi: "Đi Game Center không? (nhắc lại câu hỏi)"
      textEn: "Want to go to the Game Center? (repeating the question)"
      nextNodeId: n_invite_echo
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: ResponseAccuracy
        value: -4
        reason: "Lặp lại câu mời thay vì trả lời"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
      setFlags: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_invite_echo
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_invite
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Kim
    speakerId: npc_classmate_kim
    textJa: "あはは、それは、わたしのしつもんですよ！「はい、行きましょう」か「すみません」ですね。"
    textReading: "あはは、それは、わたしのしつもんですよ！「はい、いきましょう」か「すみません」ですね。"
    textVi: "Haha, đó là câu tớ hỏi mà! Phải trả lời 「はい、行きましょう」 hoặc 「すみません」 chứ."
    textEn: "Haha, that's my question! You answer with 「はい、行きましょう」 or 「すみません」."
    textRomaji: "Ahaha, sore wa, watashi no shitsumon desu yo! \"Hai, ikimashou\" ka \"sumimasen\" desu ne."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_invite_later
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Kim
    speakerId: npc_classmate_kim
    textJa: "そうですか。じゃあ、あしたはどうですか。ゲームで、かずのれんしゅうができますよ！"
    textReading: "そうですか。じゃあ、あしたはどうですか。ゲームで、かずのれんしゅうができますよ！"
    textVi: "Vậy à. Thế ngày mai thì sao? Chơi game mà luyện được số đếm đấy!"
    textEn: "I see. How about tomorrow then? You can practise numbers with the games!"
    textRomaji: "Sou desu ka. Jaa, ashita wa dou desu ka. Geemu de, kazu no renshuu ga dekimasu yo!"
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "あしたなら、だいじょうぶです。行きましょう。"
      textVi: "Ngày mai thì được. Đi nhé."
      textEn: "Tomorrow is fine. Let's go."
      nextNodeId: n_walk_tomorrow
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 8
        reason: "Dùng なら để nêu điều kiện, nhận lời bằng 〜ましょう"
      grammarTags:
      - grammar.n5.nara
      - grammar.n5.mashou
      vocabularyTags:
      - vocab.n5.ashita
      setFlags:
      - kim.arcade
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
